  "originalText": "[Code Name] Cairn\n[Gender] Female\n[Guide Experience] 5 Years\n[Place of Birth] Columbia\n[Date of Birth] Jul 24\n[Race] Feline\n[Height] 165cm\n[Infection Status]\nConfirmed Infected by medical examination.",
