  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Ferne Barn, born in Columbia, owner of an independent travel agency that claims there is no place they won't go. She is also the sole employee of said agency other than the late Martin Barn, honorary director.\nAs she receives treatment at Rhodes Island, she also reached an agreement with us to perform guide functions on field missions under the code name 'Cairn'."
